🧱 1️⃣ Frontend System Structure
Core Principle

Frontend should be:

Thin logic

Backend-driven state

No progression logic in frontend

Stateless UI (backend is source of truth)

Suggested Stack (Simple + Stable)

You can use:

React (recommended)

OR Next.js (if you want routing + SSR)

Tailwind for UI

Axios or Fetch for API

