🧩 2️⃣ Phase 0: API Contract Freeze (MANDATORY)

Before frontend implementation, freeze exact v1 contract from current backend routes.

Current route reality (from backend):

Practice domain: /practice/*

Analytics domain: /analytics/*

Supporting data: /sessions, /songs

Student domain (production wrappers):

/student/profile

/student/curriculum

/student/analytics

/student/streak

Debug domain: /debug/* only when DEBUG_ENDPOINTS is enabled

Rules:

Do NOT use /debug/* as production frontend dependency.

Use /student/* wrappers as the default frontend contract for Dashboard/Curriculum/Progress/Streak data.

Freeze for each endpoint:

Request shape

Response success shape

Fallback/error/message shape

Null/empty behavior

Auth/user identity requirement

🧠 3️⃣ Core Frontend Screens (v1)

Keep it minimal and powerful.

1️⃣ Dashboard (Home)

Shows:

Current level

Current streak

Composite score snapshot

Recommended content

Newly unlocked content badge

Data source:

Use frozen non-debug production endpoints only, preferring:

GET /student/profile?user_id=...

GET /student/analytics?user_id=...

GET /student/streak?user_id=...

2️⃣ Practice Screen

Workflow:

Upload audio (WAV/MP3/M4A/OGG/FLAC)
→ Call /practice endpoint
→ Show:

Note accuracy

Pitch stability

Rhythm stability

Technique score

Adaptive recommendation

Unlock event (if triggered)

Important:
Frontend does NOT calculate anything.
It renders backend result only.

Audio decision for v1:

Support both upload and in-browser live recording.

Content readiness note (songs catalog):

Currently available in `songs/`: `alankar_1` to `alankar_10`.

Initial beginner pack completion status: done (`alankar_1` to `alankar_10` in consistent JSON structure).

Recorded audio is converted to WAV client-side when possible.

If client-side WAV conversion fails, raw recorded audio is submitted and backend conversion/processing handles it.

3️⃣ Curriculum Screen

Shows:

Unlocked content

Locked content

Mastered content

Next goal (composite threshold)

Everything comes from backend snapshot (GET /student/curriculum?user_id=...).

4️⃣ Progress / Analytics Screen

Show:

Composite over time

Trend slope

Consistency index

Streak chart

Use:

analytics snapshots

streak/session data

Chart library: Recharts / Chart.js

🧬 4️⃣ Frontend State Model (Normalized, Defensive)

Global UI state remains 3 domains, but sourced via adapters.

1️⃣ Student Profile (normalized)
2️⃣ Practice Result (normalized)
3️⃣ Analytics Snapshot (normalized)

Adapter requirements:

Handle mixed response shapes.

Handle fallback message-only payloads.

Apply defaults for missing optional fields.

Map all backend variants to one stable frontend contract.

Never leak raw backend shape directly into page components.

🔐 5️⃣ Frontend Rules (Critical)
NEVER DO:

Unlock logic in frontend

Mastery counting in frontend

Streak calculations in frontend

Composite recalculation in frontend

Frontend is display only.

🛡️ 6️⃣ Cross-Cutting Concerns (Required for v1)

Auth & identity propagation:

Decide one identity path for all calls (token/header or explicit user param).

Every API call must include consistent user identity context.

Network behavior:

Single API base URL via env (dev/stage/prod).

Request timeout defaults and one retry policy for idempotent GETs.

Centralized error mapping in api/client.ts.

Screen states (every page):

Loading state

Error state with retry action

Empty state with clear guidance

